== r3.92 (D3): EncodeDate is checked: a day that does not exist in its month
== breaks a precondition.
Use Std.DateTime

Main :
    PutLn(EncodeDate(2024, 2, 29))
    PutLn(EncodeDate(2026, 2, 29))
;
